{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-21-1","title":"Proverbs 21:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>16:1,9; 20:24; Ezr 7:27,28; Ne 1:11; 2:4; Ps 105:25; 106:46; Da 4:35 Ac 7:10 as. Ps 74:15; 93:4; 114:3,5; Isa 43:19; 44:27; Re 16:4,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-2","title":"Proverbs 21:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>right. 16:2,25; 20:6; 30:12; Ps 36:2; Lu 18:11,12; Ga 6:3; Jas 1:22 the Lord. 24:12; 1Sa 16:7; Jer 17:10; Lu 16:15; Joh 2:24,25; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-3","title":"Proverbs 21:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>15:8; 1Sa 15:22; Ps 50:8; Isa 1:11-17; Jer 7:21-23; Ho 6:6 Mic 6:6-8; Mr 12:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-4","title":"Proverbs 21:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>An high look. Heb. Haughtiness of eyes. 6:17; 8:13; 30:13; Ps 10:4; Isa 2:11,17; 3:16; Lu 18:14; 1Pe 5:5 and the. 27; 15:8; Ro 14:23 plowing of the wicked. or, light of the wicked.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-5","title":"Proverbs 21:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thoughts. 10:4; 13:4; 27:23-27; Eph 4:28; 1Th 4:11,12 of every. 14:29; 20:21; 28:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-6","title":"Proverbs 21:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>getting. 10:2; 13:11; 20:14,21; 22:8; 30:8; Jer 17:11; 1Ti 6:9,10; Tit 1:11 2Pe 2:3 seek. 8:36; Eze 18:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-7","title":"Proverbs 21:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>robbery. 1:18,19; 10:6; 22:22,23; Ps 7:16; 9:16; Isa 1:23,24; Jer 7:9-11,15 Eze 22:13,14; Mic 3:9-12 destroy them. Heb. saw them, or, dwell with them. Zec 5:3,4 because. 21; Eze 18:18; Eph 5:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-8","title":"Proverbs 21:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>way. Ge 6:5,6,12; Job 15:14-16; Ps 14:2,3; Ec 7:29; 9:3; 1Co 3:3 Eph 2:2,3; Tit 3:3 but. 15:26; 30:12; Da 12:10; Mt 5:8; 12:33; Ac 15:9; Tit 1:15; 2:14; 3:5 1Pe 1:22,23; 1Jo 2:29; 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-9","title":"Proverbs 21:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>better. 19; 12:4; 19:13; 25:24; 27:15,16 brawling woman in a wide house. Heb. woman of contentions ina house of society. 15:17; 17:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-10","title":"Proverbs 21:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>soul. 3:29; 12:12; Ps 36:4; 52:2,3; Mr 7:21,22; 1Co 10:6; Jas 4:1-5 1Jo 2:16 findeth no favour. Heb. is not favoured. 13; 1Sa 25:8-11; Ps 112:5,9; Isa 32:6-8; Mic 3:2,3; Jas 2:13; 5:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-11","title":"Proverbs 21:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the scorner. 19:25; Nu 16:34; De 13:11; 21:21; Ps 64:7-9; Ac 5:5,11-14 1Co 10:6-11; Heb 2:1-3; 10:28,29; Re 11:13 when the wise. 1:5; 9:9; 15:14; 18:1,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-12","title":"Proverbs 21:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>wisely. Job 5:3; 8:15; 18:14-21; 21:28-30; 27:13-23; Ps 37:35,36; 52:5 Ps 107:43; Ho 14:9; Hab 2:9-12 overthroweth. 11:3-5; 13:6; 14:32; Ge 19:29; Am 4:11; 1Co 10:5; 2Pe 2:4-9; 3:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-13","title":"Proverbs 21:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>stoppeth. Ps 58:4; Zec 7:11; Ac 7:57 at. 28:27; De 15:7-11; Ne 5:1-5,13; Isa 1:15-17; 58:6-9; Jer 34:16,17 Zec 7:9-13; Mt 6:14; 7:2; 18:30-35; 25:41-46; Jas 2:13-16 cry himself. 1:28; Ps 18:41; Lu 13:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-14","title":"Proverbs 21:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>gift. 17:8,23; 18:16; 19:6; Ge 32:20; 43:11; 1Sa 25:35 in secret. Mt 6:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-15","title":"Proverbs 21:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>joy. Job 29:12-17; Ps 40:8; 112:1; 119:16,92; Ec 3:12; Isa 64:5 Joh 4:34; Ro 7:22 destruction. 12; 5:20; 10:29; Mt 7:23; 13:41,42; Lu 13:27,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-16","title":"Proverbs 21:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>wandereth. 13:20; Ps 125:5; Zep 1:6; Joh 3:19,20; Heb 6:4-6; 10:26,27,38 2Pe 2:21,22; 1Jo 2:19 remain. 2:18,19; 7:26,27; 9:18; Eph 2:1; Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-17","title":"Proverbs 21:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>loveth. 20; 5:10,11; 23:21; Lu 15:13-16; 16:24,25; 1Ti 5:6; 2Ti 3:4 pleasure. Heb. sport.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-18","title":"Proverbs 21:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>wicked. 11:8; Isa 43:3,4; 53:4,5; 55:8,9; 1Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-19","title":"Proverbs 21:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>better. 9; Ps 55:6,7; 120:5,6; Jer 9:2 wilderness. Heb. land of the desert.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-20","title":"Proverbs 21:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>treasure. 10:22; 15:6; Ps 112:3; Ec 5:19; 7:11; 10:19; Mt 6:19,20; Lu 6:45 oil. Ps 23:5; Jer 41:8; Mt 25:3,4 but. Mt 25:3,4,8; Lu 15:14; 16:1,19-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-21","title":"Proverbs 21:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>that. 15:9; Isa 51:1; Ho 6:3; Mt 5:6; Ro 14:19; Php 3:12; 1Th 5:21 1Ti 6:11; 2Ti 2:22; Heb 12:14 findeth. 22:4; Ro 2:7-10; 1Co 15:58; 2Ti 4:7,8; 1Pe 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-22","title":"Proverbs 21:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>2Sa 20:16-22; Ec 7:19; 9:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-23","title":"Proverbs 21:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>10:19; 12:13; 13:3; 17:27,28; 18:21; Jas 1:26; 3:2-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-24","title":"Proverbs 21:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>haughty. 6:17; 16:18; 18:12; 19:29; Es 3:5,6; Ec 7:8,9; Mt 2:16 proud wrath. Heb. the wrath of pride.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-25","title":"Proverbs 21:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>6:6-11; 12:24,27; 13:4; 15:19; 19:24; 20:4; 22:13; 24:30-34; 26:13,16 Mt 25:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-26","title":"Proverbs 21:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>coveteth. Ac 20:33-35; 1Th 2:5-9 the righteous. Ps 37:26; 112:9; Lu 6:30-36; Ac 20:35; 2Co 8:7-9; 9:9-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-27","title":"Proverbs 21:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>sacrifice. 15:8; 28:9; 1Sa 13:12,13; 15:21-23; Ps 50:8-13; Isa 1:11-16; 66:3 Jer 6:20; 7:11,12; Am 5:21,22 with a wicked mind. Heb. in wickedness. Mt 23:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-28","title":"Proverbs 21:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>false witness. Heb. witness of lies. 6:19; 19:5,9; 25:18; Ex 23:1; De 19:16-19 the man. 12:19; Ac 12:15; 2Co 1:17-20; 4:13; Tit 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-29","title":"Proverbs 21:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>hardeneth. 28:14; 29:1; Jer 3:2,3; 5:3; 8:12; 44:16,17 he directeth. or, he considereth. 11:5; Ps 119:59; Eze 18:28; Hag 1:5,7; 2:15,18,19; Lu 15:17,18 1Th 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-30","title":"Proverbs 21:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>19:21; Isa 7:5-7; 8:9,10; 14:27; 46:10,11; Jer 9:23; Jon 1:13 Ac 4:27,28; 5:39; 1Pe 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-21-31","title":"Proverbs 21:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>horse. Ps 20:7; 33:17,18; 147:10; Ec 9:11; Isa 31:1 but. Ps 3:3,8; 68:20 safety. or, victory. Ps 144:10; *marg:</p>"}]}